WEBVTT

00:04:28.166 --> 00:04:34.133
and the exhibition was used
as a platform to launch his voice.

00:04:34.133 --> 00:04:37.820
Through reclamation of our narrative,

00:04:37.820 --> 00:04:43.319
we will continue to fight historic erasure
and socioeconomic inequality.

00:04:44.179 --> 00:04:46.370
Thank you.

00:04:46.370 --> 00:04:50.400
(Applause)